xneur-xtest (0.21.0-xtest1) jammy; urgency=medium

  * Unofficial patched build of xneur/gxneur 0.21.0 (xneur-devel fork,
    commit 5a96481).
  * Inject the corrected word with XTestFakeKeyEvent instead of XSendEvent,
    so xterm and VTE terminals accept it.
  * Delete the word together with the delimiter that was already delivered
    and re-send the delimiter after the corrected word.
  * Filter the XI2 echo of the program's own XTEST injection, flush the
    filter on focus change, and drop the autocompletion/education defaults.
  * Ship an XDG autostart entry for gxneur.

 -- ajaxiis-rust <ajaxiis-rust@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:30:00 +0300
